<li>Edward S. Kennedy. (1998), Astronomy and Astrology in the Medieval Islamic World. Brookfield, VT: Ashgate.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Pranala luar</h2>
<ul>
<li>Arabian Astrology by James Holden</li>
<li>Towards a Post-Modern Astrology by Robert Hand</li>
